<h2 id="usage">Usage</h2>
<p>Run the executable with <code>--help</code> to see its available commands and options:</p>
{% ansiOutput "maze-help.ansi" %}

<h2 id="run-examples">Run examples</h2>

<h3 id="generating-a-maze">Generating a maze</h3>
<p>Generate a 20×8 maze with a fixed seed, so it comes out identical on every run:</p>
{{ cmd.copyCommand("maze generate --width 20 --height 8 --seed 42") }}
{% ansiOutput "maze-generate.txt" %}
<p>The maze is printed as ASCII art, with <code>S</code> marking the start cell and <code>E</code> the end cell.</p>

<h3 id="solving-a-maze">Solving a maze</h3>
<p>Solve that same maze with the A* algorithm:</p>
{{ cmd.copyCommand("maze solve --width 20 --height 8 --seed 42 --algorithm astar") }}
{% ansiOutput "maze-solve.txt" %}
<p>The solved maze shows the path from start to end as arrows, followed by the number of steps and the algorithm
  that was used.</p>
